#: scripts/campaign/mission_03.gd:1819
msgid "The Wood Will Remember"
msgstr "Le bois se souviendra"

#. [&"narrator", "Crown Hollow. Where the Master once sat, two armies wait for the sun."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_04.gd:91 data/voice/lines/m04.json:L1
msgid "Crown Hollow. Where the Master once sat, two armies wait for the sun."
msgstr "Crown Hollow. Là où siégeait le Maître, deux armées attendent le soleil."

#. [&"malrik", "Three relics, little ember. Hand them over and I'll let you keep the hat."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_04.gd:92 data/voice/lines/m04.json:L2
msgid "Three relics, little ember. Hand them over and I'll let you keep the hat."
msgstr "Trois reliques, petite braise. Donne-les et je te laisse le chapeau."

#. [&"vessa", "Come and take them, Bishop. You owe me for Emberfall. And for Vey."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_04.gd:93 data/voice/lines/m04.json:L3
msgid "Come and take them, Bishop. You owe me for Emberfall. And for Vey."
msgstr "Viens les prendre, l'Évêque. Tu me dois Emberfall. Et Vey."

#. [&"whisper", "Yes. Come, both of you. Fight on my roof."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_04.gd:94 data/voice/lines/m04.json:L4
msgid "Yes. Come, both of you. Fight on my roof."
msgstr "Oui. Venez, tous deux. Battez-vous sur mon toit."

#. [&"obren", "Yes. Fight. Every fallen soldier is a step on my stair."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_04.gd:95 data/voice/lines/m04.json:L5
msgid "Yes. Fight. Every fallen soldier is a step on my stair."
msgstr "Oui. Battez-vous. Chaque mort est une marche de mon escalier."

#. [&"vessa", "The ground is breathing. That can't be good."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_04.gd:96 data/voice/lines/m04.json:L6
msgid "The ground is breathing. That can't be good."
msgstr "Le sol respire. Ça ne peut pas être bon."

#. [&"obren", "A hundred years in the dark. I had time to practise my entrance."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_04.gd:97 data/voice/lines/m04.json:L7
msgid "A hundred years in the dark. I had time to practise my entrance."
msgstr "Cent ans dans le noir. J'ai eu le temps de répéter mon entrée."

#. [&"vessa", "I had ten minutes to practise running. Those pillars feed it. Break them all!"],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_04.gd:98 data/voice/lines/m04.json:L8
msgid "I had ten minutes to practise running. Those pillars feed it. Break them all!"
msgstr "J'ai eu dix minutes pour répéter ma fuite. Ces piliers le nourrissent. Brisez-les tous !"

#. [&"malrik", "A giant made of rubble, in MY war? Shades, kill the pillars. Then kill Vessa."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_04.gd:99 data/voice/lines/m04.json:L9
msgid "A giant made of rubble, in MY war? Shades, kill the pillars. Then kill Vessa."
msgstr "Un géant de gravats, dans MA guerre ? Shades, détruisez les piliers. Puis tuez Vessa."

#. [&"vessa", "Two down. Keep hitting the glowing parts. It's always the glowing parts."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_04.gd:100 data/voice/lines/m04.json:L10
msgid "Two down. Keep hitting the glowing parts. It's always the glowing parts."
msgstr "Deux de tombés. Frappez les parties qui brillent. C'est toujours elles."

#. [&"obren", "Enough. I will walk to your little fire and put it out myself."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_04.gd:101 data/voice/lines/m04.json:L11
msgid "Enough. I will walk to your little fire and put it out myself."
msgstr "Assez. J'irai à ton petit feu et je l'éteindrai moi-même."

#. [&"obren", "This body... cracks... No matter. Stone is patient."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_04.gd:102 data/voice/lines/m04.json:L12
msgid "This body... cracks... No matter. Stone is patient."
msgstr "Ce corps... se fend... Peu importe. La pierre est patiente."

#. [&"vessa", "Not the keep! I JUST had it redecorated!"],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_04.gd:103 data/voice/lines/m04.json:L13
msgid "Not the keep! I JUST had it redecorated!"
msgstr "Pas le donjon ! Je VIENS de le redécorer !"

#. [&"vessa", "Everyone, back to the keep! BACK!"],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_04.gd:104 data/voice/lines/m04.json:L14
msgid "Everyone, back to the keep! BACK!"
msgstr "Tout le monde, au donjon ! REPLI !"

#. [&"vey", "Stay close, girl. Whatever it throws at you, I'll ground it."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_04.gd:105 data/voice/lines/m04.json:L15
msgid "Stay close, girl. Whatever it throws at you, I'll ground it."
msgstr "Reste près de moi, petite. Quoi qu'il te lance, je le détourne."

#. [&"vessa", "Crown, orb, signet. Let's see what you do together."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_04.gd:106 data/voice/lines/m04.json:L16
msgid "Crown, orb, signet. Let's see what you do together."
msgstr "Couronne, orbe, sceau. Voyons ce que vous faites ensemble."

#. [&"obren", "His storm? Impossible! That light should have faded a hundred years ago!"],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_04.gd:107 data/voice/lines/m04.json:L17
msgid "His storm? Impossible! That light should have faded a hundred years ago!"
msgstr "Sa tempête ? Impossible ! Cette lumière aurait dû s'éteindre il y a cent ans !"

#. [&"vessa", "Nobody stays faded around here. Ask Vey."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_04.gd:108 data/voice/lines/m04.json:L18
msgid "Nobody stays faded around here. Ask Vey."
msgstr "Personne ne reste éteint, ici. Demande à Vey."

#. [&"vey", "The spark was yours, Vessa. NOW the storm!"],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_04.gd:109 data/voice/lines/m04.json:L19
msgid "The spark was yours, Vessa. NOW the storm!"
msgstr "À toi l'étincelle, Vessa. MAINTENANT, l'orage !"

#. [&"vessa", "Somebody... finish my war..."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_04.gd:110 data/voice/lines/m04.json:L20
msgid "Somebody... finish my war..."
msgstr "Finissez... ma guerre..."

#. [&"obren", "The Hollow... remembers..."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_04.gd:111 data/voice/lines/m04.json:L21
msgid "The Hollow... remembers..."
msgstr "Le Hollow... se souvient..."

#. [&"vey", "Just resting my knees. Keep turning that key!"],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_04.gd:112 data/voice/lines/m04.json:L23
msgid "Just resting my knees. Keep turning that key!"
msgstr "Je repose mes genoux. Continue de tourner la clé !"

#. [&"malrik", "One pillar down. You're welcome, little ember. Don't get used to it."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_04.gd:113 data/voice/lines/m04.json:L24
msgid "One pillar down. You're welcome, little ember. Don't get used to it."
msgstr "Un pilier de tombé. De rien, petite braise. Prends pas l'habitude."

#. [&"malrik", "An old man and a thunderstorm. Shades, fall back. I'll collect whatever is left."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_04.gd:114 data/voice/lines/m04.json:L25
msgid "An old man and a thunderstorm. Shades, fall back. I'll collect whatever is left."
msgstr "Un vieillard et un orage. Shades, repli. Je ramasserai ce qui reste."

#. [&"pell", "Last stall before the end of the world! Everything must go. Including me, quickly."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_04.gd:115 data/voice/lines/m04.json:L26
msgid "Last stall before the end of the world! Everything must go. Including me, quickly."
msgstr "Dernier étal avant la fin du monde ! Tout doit partir. Moi aussi, et vite."

#. "The parley failed. Ice and Nature walked away, and Malrik named the place himself: Crown Hollow, at dawn, whe
#: scripts/campaign/mission_04.gd:118
msgid "The parley failed. Ice and Nature walked away, and Malrik named the place himself: Crown Hollow, at dawn, where the Master once sat and where this war began over a crown."
msgstr "Les pourparlers ont échoué. La Glace et la Nature sont parties, et Malrik a lui-même choisi le lieu : Crown Hollow, à l'aube, là où siégeait le Maître et où cette guerre a commencé pour une couronne."

#. "Vessa carries all three relics now: the Ember Crown, the Stillwater Orb and the Master's Signet. They have st
#: scripts/campaign/mission_04.gd:119
msgid "Vessa carries all three relics now: the Ember Crown, the Stillwater Orb and the Master's Signet. They have stopped humming. They are pulling, toward the ruined throne on Crown Isle, and the voice inside them sounds very pleased."
msgstr "Vessa porte maintenant les trois reliques : l'Ember Crown, le Stillwater Orb et le Master's Signet. Elles ne bourdonnent plus. Elles tirent, vers le trône en ruine de Crown Isle, et la voix en elles semble très satisfaite."

#. "Ysolde called the relics a lock. Somewhere under the isle, something has been counting every soldier who fall
#: scripts/campaign/mission_04.gd:120
msgid "Ysolde called the relics a lock. Somewhere under the isle, something has been counting every soldier who falls. Vessa means to end the war today. She is about to find out what the war has been feeding."
msgstr "Ysolde a dit que les reliques étaient une serrure. Quelque part sous l'île, quelque chose compte chaque soldat qui tombe. Vessa veut finir la guerre aujourd'hui. Elle va découvrir ce que la guerre nourrissait."

#. const BRIEFING_HOLLOW_LINE := "Every fallen soldier feeds the Hollow."
#: scripts/campaign/mission_04.gd:122
msgid "Every fallen soldier feeds the Hollow."
msgstr "Chaque soldat tombé nourrit le Hollow."

#. const HINT_START := "Every death feeds the Hollow. Take the Master's seat on Crown Isle when YOU are ready."
#: scripts/campaign/mission_04.gd:123
msgid "Every death feeds the Hollow. Take the Master's seat on Crown Isle when YOU are ready."
msgstr "Chaque mort nourrit le Hollow. Prenez le trône du Maître sur Crown Isle quand VOUS êtes prêt."

#. const HINT_ISLE := "Clear the isle of Shadow, then stand on the Throne stone for 3 s."
#: scripts/campaign/mission_04.gd:124
msgid "Clear the isle of Shadow, then stand on the Throne stone for 3 s."
msgstr "Chassez l'Ombre de l'île, puis tenez-vous sur la pierre du Trône pendant 3 s."

#. const HINT_PYLONS := "Break the four Keystone Pylons. The Colossus cannot be hurt while one stands."
#: scripts/campaign/mission_04.gd:125
msgid "Break the four Keystone Pylons. The Colossus cannot be hurt while one stands."
msgstr "Brisez les quatre Keystone Pylons. Le Colosse est invulnérable tant qu'il en reste un."

#. const HINT_KEY := "Stand within 4 m of the Colossus for 3 s with Vessa. Keep Old Vey close: the Hollow Pulse c
#: scripts/campaign/mission_04.gd:126
msgid "Stand within 4 m of the Colossus for 3 s with Vessa. Keep Old Vey close: the Hollow Pulse can't break the key while he grounds it."
msgstr "Restez à moins de 4 m du Colosse pendant 3 s avec Vessa. Gardez Old Vey près d'elle : la Hollow Pulse ne peut briser la clé tant qu'il la protège."

#. const MSG_HOLLOW_25 := "The ground under Crown Hollow is warm."
#: scripts/campaign/mission_04.gd:127
msgid "The ground under Crown Hollow is warm."
msgstr "Le sol sous Crown Hollow est tiède."

#. const MSG_GUARD_FALLS_BACK := "Malrik's isle guard falls back to his army."
#: scripts/campaign/mission_04.gd:128
msgid "Malrik's isle guard falls back to his army."
msgstr "La garde de l'île de Malrik se replie vers son armée."

#. const MSG_STAGGER := "The Colossus staggers!"
#: scripts/campaign/mission_04.gd:130
msgid "The Colossus staggers!"
msgstr "Le Colosse chancelle !"

#. const MSG_VEY_DOWN := "Old Vey is down! The storm will return."
#: scripts/campaign/mission_04.gd:131
msgid "Old Vey is down! The storm will return."
msgstr "Old Vey est à terre ! La tempête reviendra."

#. const MSG_SEAT_BLOCKED := "Shadow still holds the isle"
#: scripts/campaign/mission_04.gd:132
msgid "Shadow still holds the isle"
msgstr "L'Ombre tient encore l'île"

#. const CARD_RISE_TEXT := "The Throne stone cracks. Amber light pours up through the isle, the pillars fall into
#: scripts/campaign/mission_04.gd:134
msgid "The Throne stone cracks. Amber light pours up through the isle, the pillars fall into the moat, and a giant of rubble and old stone climbs out of the Hollow, a burning heart in its chest. Four pillars rise around the water, each feeding it a golden thread."
msgstr "La pierre du Trône se fend. Une lumière ambrée jaillit de l'île, les piliers tombent dans les douves, et un géant de gravats et de vieille pierre sort du Hollow, un cœur brûlant dans la poitrine. Quatre piliers se dressent autour de l'eau, chacun le nourrissant d'un fil d'or."

#. const CARD_STORM_TEXT := "The Colossus raises its fist over Vessa. Thunder answers. A bolt splits the sky, the
#: scripts/campaign/mission_04.gd:135
msgid "The Colossus raises its fist over Vessa. Thunder answers. A bolt splits the sky, the giant staggers to its knees, and out of the storm walks an old man with a sword that hums like a struck bell. Old Vey is alive."
msgstr "Le Colosse lève le poing sur Vessa. Le tonnerre répond. Un éclair fend le ciel, le géant tombe à genoux, et de l'orage sort un vieil homme dont l'épée vibre comme une cloche frappée. Old Vey est vivant."

#. const CARD_ENDING_TEXT := "Fire and lightning shatter the heart. Obren's body falls. In the grey dawn Malrik p
#: scripts/campaign/mission_04.gd:136
msgid "Fire and lightning shatter the heart. Obren's body falls. In the grey dawn Malrik picks up the still-pulsing heart-stone and melts into the mist with it while the Shadow army withdraws. Vey tells Vessa the Master is alive below, and the three relics turn white-gold and point down."
msgstr "Le feu et la foudre brisent le cœur. Le corps d'Obren s'effondre. Dans l'aube grise, Malrik ramasse la pierre-cœur qui bat encore et se fond dans la brume pendant que l'armée de l'Ombre se retire. Vey dit à Vessa que le Maître est vivant, en bas, et les trois reliques virent à l'or blanc et pointent vers le sol."

#. const CARD_CREDITS_TEXT := "Episode 1: The Hollow Throne. Thank you for playing. Episode 2 begins where the re
#: scripts/campaign/mission_04.gd:137
msgid "Episode 1: The Hollow Throne. Thank you for playing. Episode 2 begins where the relics point: down."
msgstr "Épisode 1 : The Hollow Throne. Merci d'avoir joué. L'épisode 2 commence là où pointent les reliques : en bas."

#. c.victory_banner = "VICTORY\nThe Hollow Throne is broken"
#: scripts/campaign/mission_04.gd:216
msgid "VICTORY\nThe Hollow Throne is broken"
msgstr "VICTOIRE\nLe Hollow Throne est brisé"

#. return "Mission 4: %s" % MISSION_TITLE
#: scripts/campaign/mission_04.gd:237
msgid "Mission 4: %s"
msgstr "Mission 4 : %s"

