#: scripts/campaign/mission_04.gd:503
msgid "Turn the key: Vessa by the Colossus's heart, with Old Vey beside her"
msgstr "Tourner la clé : Vessa au cœur du Colosse, Old Vey à ses côtés"

#. return "The Fire keep must stand"
